{"id":"vol8-06","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-06/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":361.26,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.06,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.38],["turn",0.38,0.66],["to",0.66,0.86],["section",0.86,1.1],["2",1.1,1.66],["on",1.66,2.2],["page",2.2,2.48],["3.",2.48,3.06]]},{"start":5.76,"end":6.62,"text":"Section 2.","words":[["Section",5.76,6.0],["2.",6.0,6.62]]},{"start":7.7,"end":13.44,"text":"You'll hear the director of a cooking school talking to a group of people about the different programs.","words":[["You'll",7.7,8.12],["hear",8.12,8.3],["the",8.3,8.48],["director",8.48,8.88],["of",8.88,9.16],["a",9.16,9.28],["cooking",9.28,9.5],["school",9.5,10.0],["talking",10.0,10.66],["to",10.66,10.98],["a",10.98,11.14],["group",11.14,11.3],["of",11.3,11.48],["people",11.48,11.8],["about",11.8,12.24],["the",12.24,12.48],["different",12.48,12.78],["programs.",12.78,13.44]]},{"start":14.56,"end":19.7,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16 on page 3.","words":[["First",14.56,15.0],["you",15.0,15.22],["have",15.22,15.36],["some",15.36,15.52],["time",15.52,15.9],["to",15.9,16.14],["look",16.14,16.28],["at",16.28,16.4],["questions",16.4,16.68],["11",16.68,17.22],["to",17.22,17.5],["16",17.5,17.98],["on",17.98,18.86],["page",18.86,19.2],["3.",19.2,19.7]]},{"start":50.22,"end":53.78,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["Now",50.22,50.52],["listen",50.52,50.86],["carefully",50.86,51.3],["and",51.3,51.68],["answer",51.68,52.08],["questions",52.08,52.48],["11",52.48,53.08],["to",53.08,53.34],["16.",53.34,53.78]]},{"start":57.22,"end":58.9,"text":"Welcome to the cooking school.","words":[["Welcome",57.22,57.86],["to",57.86,58.12],["the",58.12,58.26],["cooking",58.26,58.46],["school.",58.46,58.9]]},{"start":59.46,"end":61.52,"text":"I am Julie Brooks, head of programs.","words":[["I",59.46,59.8],["am",59.8,59.94],["Julie",59.94,60.18],["Brooks,",60.18,60.52],["head",60.82,61.02],["of",61.02,61.16],["programs.",61.16,61.52]]},{"start":61.52,"end":67.16,"text":"I'm here to give you information about the different tours and classes we offer, as well","words":[["I'm",61.52,62.58],["here",62.58,62.72],["to",62.72,62.86],["give",62.86,63.06],["you",63.06,63.18],["information",63.18,63.64],["about",63.64,64.2],["the",64.2,64.38],["different",64.38,64.66],["tours",64.66,64.98],["and",64.98,65.28],["classes",65.28,65.68],["we",65.68,65.9],["offer,",65.9,66.24],["as",66.8,66.96],["well",66.96,67.16]]},{"start":67.16,"end":69.4,"text":"as to show you our cooking facilities here.","words":[["as",67.16,67.34],["to",67.34,67.5],["show",67.5,67.76],["you",67.76,67.92],["our",67.92,68.12],["cooking",68.12,68.4],["facilities",68.4,68.9],["here.",68.9,69.4]]},{"start":70.24,"end":72.22,"text":"Our tours and classes are very popular.","words":[["Our",70.24,70.4],["tours",70.4,70.6],["and",70.6,70.8],["classes",70.8,71.12],["are",71.12,71.38],["very",71.38,71.76],["popular.",71.76,72.22]]},{"start":73.26,"end":79.14,"text":"The most popular cooking tour is in the early summer in Northern California, which is famous","words":[["The",73.26,73.42],["most",73.42,73.7],["popular",73.7,74.18],["cooking",74.18,74.52],["tour",74.52,74.86],["is",74.86,75.14],["in",75.14,75.36],["the",75.36,75.54],["early",75.54,75.94],["summer",75.94,76.36],["in",76.36,76.7],["Northern",76.7,77.04],["California,",77.04,77.78],["which",78.1,78.52],["is",78.52,78.68],["famous",78.68,79.14]]},{"start":79.14,"end":80.04,"text":"for its cheeses.","words":[["for",79.14,79.46],["its",79.46,79.62],["cheeses.",79.62,80.04]]},{"start":81.0,"end":85.58,"text":"This four-day tour is special because each student receives one-on-one classes with","words":[["This",81.0,81.34],["four",81.34,81.6],["-day",81.6,81.74],["tour",81.74,82.04],["is",82.04,82.26],["special",82.26,82.56],["because",82.56,82.86],["each",82.86,83.2],["student",83.2,83.56],["receives",83.56,84.06],["one",84.06,84.48],["-on",84.48,84.66],["-one",84.66,84.84],["classes",84.84,85.26],["with",85.26,85.58]]},{"start":85.58,"end":86.58,"text":"the master chef.","words":[["the",85.58,85.78],["master",85.78,86.12],["chef.",86.12,86.58]]},{"start":86.58,"end":92.2,"text":"Then you'll take part in visits to the great cheese producers of the region and","words":[["Then",86.58,87.68],["you'll",87.68,88.26],["take",88.26,88.42],["part",88.42,88.74],["in",88.74,88.92],["visits",88.92,89.16],["to",89.16,89.48],["the",89.48,89.64],["great",89.64,89.88],["cheese",89.88,90.28],["producers",90.28,90.74],["of",90.74,91.06],["the",91.06,91.18],["region",91.18,91.46],["and",91.46,92.2]]},{"start":92.2,"end":98.04,"text":"you'll taste cheeses and see how they are made. If you're looking to take a really","words":[["you'll",92.2,92.42],["taste",92.42,92.66],["cheeses",92.66,93.16],["and",93.16,93.44],["see",93.44,93.74],["how",93.74,94.14],["they",94.14,94.34],["are",94.34,94.46],["made.",94.46,94.7],["If",95.92,96.56],["you're",96.56,96.72],["looking",96.72,96.96],["to",96.96,97.22],["take",97.22,97.48],["a",97.48,97.7],["really",97.7,98.04]]},{"start":98.04,"end":103.38,"text":"adventurous vacation, take one of our cooking vacations in Italy and learn the","words":[["adventurous",98.04,98.62],["vacation,",98.62,99.26],["take",99.7,100.06],["one",100.06,100.38],["of",100.38,100.58],["our",100.58,100.74],["cooking",100.74,101.02],["vacations",101.02,101.72],["in",101.72,101.9],["Italy",101.9,102.24],["and",102.24,102.94],["learn",102.94,103.18],["the",103.18,103.38]]},{"start":103.38,"end":108.76,"text":"passion of the Italian kitchen and have fun doing it. This cooking vacation","words":[["passion",103.38,103.78],["of",103.78,104.1],["the",104.1,104.22],["Italian",104.22,104.66],["kitchen",104.66,105.1],["and",105.1,105.76],["have",105.76,105.98],["fun",105.98,106.34],["doing",106.34,106.68],["it.",106.68,106.98],["This",107.6,107.96],["cooking",107.96,108.26],["vacation",108.26,108.76]]},{"start":108.76,"end":113.74,"text":"takes place in a historic villa. There will be time to relax and enjoy the","words":[["takes",108.76,109.14],["place",109.14,109.44],["in",109.44,109.8],["a",109.8,109.92],["historic",109.92,110.28],["villa.",110.28,110.72],["There",111.42,111.78],["will",111.78,111.92],["be",111.92,112.06],["time",112.06,112.32],["to",112.32,112.52],["relax",112.52,112.9],["and",112.9,113.24],["enjoy",113.24,113.54],["the",113.54,113.74]]},{"start":113.74,"end":119.32,"text":"surroundings or to do some sightseeing in the area. On the second day a bus","words":[["surroundings",113.74,114.22],["or",114.22,114.82],["to",114.82,114.96],["do",114.96,115.14],["some",115.14,115.36],["sightseeing",115.36,116.08],["in",116.08,116.26],["the",116.26,116.38],["area.",116.38,116.74],["On",117.58,118.1],["the",118.1,118.24],["second",118.24,118.52],["day",118.52,118.86],["a",118.86,119.12],["bus",119.12,119.32]]},{"start":119.32,"end":124.74,"text":"excursion is organized leaving after lunch with visits to a salami factory and","words":[["excursion",119.32,119.94],["is",119.94,120.1],["organized",120.1,120.54],["leaving",120.54,121.08],["after",121.08,121.5],["lunch",121.5,121.84],["with",121.84,122.36],["visits",122.36,122.68],["to",122.68,122.98],["a",122.98,123.22],["salami",123.22,123.62],["factory",123.62,124.04],["and",124.04,124.74]]},{"start":124.74,"end":130.8,"text":"an olive oil mill returning to the villa in time for dinner. On the third day you","words":[["an",124.74,124.9],["olive",124.9,125.16],["oil",125.16,125.48],["mill",125.48,125.82],["returning",125.82,126.78],["to",126.78,127.14],["the",127.14,127.26],["villa",127.26,127.48],["in",127.48,127.7],["time",127.7,127.98],["for",127.98,128.2],["dinner.",128.2,128.42],["On",129.36,129.92],["the",129.92,130.04],["third",130.04,130.28],["day",130.28,130.58],["you",130.58,130.8]]},{"start":130.8,"end":135.08,"text":"go to the market then cook your own dinner with a range of local ingredients.","words":[["go",130.8,130.94],["to",130.94,131.08],["the",131.08,131.2],["market",131.2,131.48],["then",131.48,132.28],["cook",132.28,132.52],["your",132.52,132.7],["own",132.7,132.98],["dinner",132.98,133.24],["with",133.24,133.52],["a",133.52,133.68],["range",133.68,133.98],["of",133.98,134.16],["local",134.16,134.46],["ingredients.",134.46,135.08]]},{"start":136.44,"end":141.06,"text":"One of the schools most popular tours is to the famous US city of New Orleans.","words":[["One",136.44,137.0],["of",137.0,137.12],["the",137.12,137.26],["schools",137.26,137.48],["most",137.48,137.8],["popular",137.8,138.3],["tours",138.3,138.66],["is",138.66,138.92],["to",138.92,139.08],["the",139.08,139.2],["famous",139.2,139.56],["US",139.56,139.94],["city",139.94,140.32],["of",140.32,140.56],["New",140.56,140.82],["Orleans.",140.82,141.06]]},{"start":141.72,"end":148.2,"text":"This is a three-day tour where you will be staying in a hotel near the city's famous French Quarter.","words":[["This",141.72,142.32],["is",142.32,142.52],["a",142.52,142.64],["three",142.64,142.92],["-day",142.92,143.26],["tour",143.26,143.66],["where",143.66,144.36],["you",144.36,144.5],["will",144.5,144.6],["be",144.6,144.7],["staying",144.7,145.02],["in",145.02,145.24],["a",145.24,145.38],["hotel",145.38,145.7],["near",145.7,146.16],["the",146.16,146.4],["city's",146.4,146.84],["famous",146.84,147.24],["French",147.24,147.8],["Quarter.",147.8,148.2]]},{"start":148.88,"end":155.78,"text":"You'll have time to explore on your own before taking a unique city tour on foot, led by a local chef.","words":[["You'll",148.88,149.18],["have",149.18,149.34],["time",149.34,149.62],["to",149.62,149.8],["explore",149.8,150.26],["on",150.26,150.5],["your",150.5,150.62],["own",150.62,151.0],["before",151.0,151.54],["taking",151.54,152.0],["a",152.0,152.34],["unique",152.34,152.72],["city",152.72,153.14],["tour",153.14,153.56],["on",153.56,153.82],["foot,",153.82,154.18],["led",154.4,154.76],["by",154.76,155.04],["a",155.04,155.18],